 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1959/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2602/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.616      1 Template:AMC12_box\n100.00%    7.616      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13957:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017182730 and revision id 260110. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}